  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Indonesian Forest Monitoring for Climate Action</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to improve Forest Monitoring for Climate Action. Technical assistance will be made available to key units in the Ministry of Environment and Forestry responsible for forest monitroing and forest inventory. This project will also facilitate a process to develop a National Forest Monitoring System Improvement Road Map.</narrative>
  </description>
